<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado beheaded six Christians and a Catholic priest was killed one day after baptising 175 people, showing continued targeting of religious figures. Mozambican police killed three robbers at a micro-credit service, indicating security actions beyond the insurgency. The United States deepened defence cooperation with Mozambique amid the insurgency, and Mozambique proposed a low-cost LNG-FSRU solution for South Africa’s gas shortage. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1SdVpvLTl3Qi01N0RVTWxpRXZJdkg4ODlRa2NIRmZDWXlreTYzc3Fac3NMWTh2NFlwMS1POVlaTVVlUWVxbF9tUmI1OGxEQWdsektXdE1UQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNUzhYWXIzZ2ZsMWw4N3VnVGRKQXVwVTRaT2dQOHNyX0ROSjlVMS01aExERjhSWXRvLXZXZy1lVFVYTHZBOHR6R2ZwbXdoa3ctSW5sNVIxRi12QVY2TVpFV2Z0cGI0My1wZHBlV25BeUZiZjRTWFQ5SGZoSjQ4eXdIY0c2YmVoa2FQN3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPOHpmdmdhTWpEZWlLOGFPS3BrZ1JEcEdKbzAyMkloM1JyOTVLYS1NS2ZiSEtqckhZVHlNdHoxaEp4OEc1bV9pNlBxRzJ5YVI4cC1jV3NPUHFwdFVscEJhZ2ljbDBIRmlkSVNjRjBScUM1R2FMX0gzOEZPQ19fOVp6WDVZWmZhelZNeS1UZ0tMa3A?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Defense Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5LelB3UTk1eWE5S1ozRzF3Sy0waVFIVVMyaHVvaDNNOVlkdlRBWHN4MzFEQ0E5cGs0dGx0eGZackpSNWRvcElGX2FHczR4UllDdzhfYmQtelF6T2tvSVp2SW4wMEFhNXJMVDdvOUZHZ1gtN292WUNfSzlVVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaama Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNVXQ5R2hkRXBFbm5hWnA0MkFxUXhDYlpRVlA5WUVKSnV4anM3Wkl5d2J5WjFaTmRvLTdSMEE4SFVjYUxHejZGWjZVa2NMeXoweE5ZSFIycXZNQy00Q3dDWGd3REc0Y2RCTVJPLWNWZTQ4UFR2VU02NVJUSGk3N